  "priorExpiration": "2003-12-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 408.04 Mooring Permit Required. No person shall erect, install, maintain, use or have control over a mooring on any body of water specified in Saf-C 408.01, unless a mooring permit has been issued by the division.\n\nSource. #4145, eff 10-6-86; ss by #4384, eff 3-10-88; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES, 5-3-95 (formerly Saf-C 408.03); ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8172, eff 9-21-04 ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
